  message: "Fixed in PR #2198. Reproduced first: the linker alone under PYTHONHASHSEED 0..4 gave three spellings of one 3-table site. Tables are now in statement order (first mention); the stable id still sorts, so no stable id moves. mastodon sub-tree across seeds 0/1/2: base 7 node ids not in every run, fixed 0. The same set order also decided meta.tables and the references edge order. Two sibling linkers with the same mechanism are fixed with a test each: ruby_ffi (which C file's registration is kept) and di_resolution (which binding is kept). napi.py:255 has it too and is left to WI-rumuv."  # 0acd
